      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/793-finger-trail-writing-is-very-bad here more test results.\n\nIt's not local only, it can send data to other side, but it's just very poor system thanks to network IK reduced data rate speed. It only track when there are movements.\n\nIf you want talk, go to one of rooms made by VRChat: Presentation Room (not Plus! or Cross-play 3D Pen) or VrChat home room. Pencils there uses own developed code for writing / drawing.",
